{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-008",
    "title": "封山钟响"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_043",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "沈砚秋没有追问期限，只把一把旧铜钥匙交给他：“明日卯时，去外门档房。第三架，最底层。只看写着‘西坡’的卷宗。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "戒律堂的火把在山道上亮了一夜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1011,
          "end": 1011
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临和顾长离没有回听雨院，而是躲进外门旧库房。库房堆着废弃的灯油桶和断裂的木架，尘土里混着一种发苦的药味。两人隔着一扇缺页的木门，听见搜山弟子从屋外经过。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1013,
          "end": 1013
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“西坡没有人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1015,
          "end": 1015
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封条动过，井口也没有痕迹。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1017,
          "end": 1017
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把杂木林再搜一遍。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1019,
          "end": 1019
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "脚步声渐渐远去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1021,
          "end": 1021
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离这才松开手里的铜针：“把残印给我看。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1023,
          "end": 1023
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临摊开手掌。淡青色纹路在皮肤下缓慢游动，像一条被困住的细蛇。它没有带来灵力，反而让他的手臂发冷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1025,
          "end": 1025
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你忘了什么？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1027,
          "end": 1027
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“北河城一棵树。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1029,
          "end": 1029
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还有吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1031,
          "end": 1031
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“暂时没有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1033,
          "end": 1033
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有安慰他，只从腰间取出一截黑线，绕在他腕上。黑线碰到残印时立刻绷紧，像在测量什么。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1035,
          "end": 1035
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这能遮住它？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1037,
          "end": 1037
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只能让别人暂时看不清。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1039,
          "end": 1039
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“包括沈砚秋？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1041,
          "end": 1041
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她若亲自查，不包括。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1043,
          "end": 1043
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天将亮时，搜山的火把终于熄灭。陆照临和顾长离从旧库房出来，沿雨廊返回登记堂。昨夜的雨又落下来，细密的水线把廊外的山景剪成一格一格。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1045,
          "end": 1045
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋已经在那里等着。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1047,
          "end": 1047
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她面前摆着三件物品：一截断灯芯、一枚半环铜片，还有一只黑漆木盒。断灯芯和陆照临藏起来的那截一模一样，铜片却比他们找到的更完整。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1049,
          "end": 1049
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“戒律堂在西坡捡到的。”沈砚秋说，“你们昨夜去了哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1051,
          "end": 1051
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离先开口：“听雨院。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1053,
          "end": 1053
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋看她：“你袖中的账单，什么时候交出来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1055,
          "end": 1055
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离的手指微微一紧。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1057,
          "end": 1057
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有说话。沈砚秋的目光从两人脸上掠过，最后落在陆照临被黑线缠住的手腕。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1059,
          "end": 1059
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你受伤了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1061,
          "end": 1061
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“旧伤。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1063,
          "end": 1063
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们都喜欢说旧伤。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1065,
          "end": 1065
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她打开黑漆木盒。盒中没有法器，只有一张被水浸过的薄纸。纸上画着一条山路，尽头标着一个模糊的驿站名。陆照临一眼认出，那正是第三章烧焦账单上“送入西坡旧井”之后被撕掉的部分。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1067,
          "end": 1067
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是陆沉舟留下的？”他问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1069,
          "end": 1069
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有回答：“你从哪里听到这个名字？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1071,
          "end": 1071
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“值房名册。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1073,
          "end": 1073
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名册已经封存。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1075,
          "end": 1075
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可我看见过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1077,
          "end": 1077
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把薄纸重新收进盒里：“看见不等于知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1079,
          "end": 1079
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "雨廊尽头忽然传来脚步声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1081,
          "end": 1081
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "来人穿着洗得发白的青衫，衣摆沾着泥，腰间挂着一枚铜环。铜环只剩半圈，却与陆照临在杂木林里捡到的那枚断片纹路相同。他走得很慢，像对玄霄宗的院落十分熟悉，又刻意不让任何弟子看清自己的脸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1083,
          "end": 1083
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋合上木盒：“这里不是外客该来的地方。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1085,
          "end": 1085
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青衫人停在雨廊另一端：“我是来还一盏灯的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1087,
          "end": 1087
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他从袖中取出一只小灯盏。灯盏没有灯芯，罩内却浮着一层青白雾气。雾气贴着玻璃转了一圈，最后凝成半个圆纹。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1089,
          "end": 1089
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋的脸色冷了下来：“叶观澜。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1091,
          "end": 1091
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青衫人笑了笑：“沈执事还记得我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1093,
          "end": 1093
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟盟的人不能进玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1095,
          "end": 1095
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我已经进来了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1097,
          "end": 1097
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜说话时，目光越过沈砚秋，落到陆照临身上。他没有问陆照临看见了什么，只问：“你愿不愿意承认自己看见过？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1099,
          "end": 1099
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“拿下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1125,
          "end": 1125
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜没有反抗。他任由弟子抓住手臂，目光仍停在陆照临身上：“旧驿道的第一座驿站，不点灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1127,
          "end": 1127
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那里已经废弃。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1133,
          "end": 1133
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临听出她话里的重量。她不是在威胁，也不是在劝告。她像是在转述一个已经发生过的结局。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1284,
          "end": 1284
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走到两人身边：“若留下，旧档会给他看吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1286,
          "end": 1286
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“会。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1288,
          "end": 1288
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“包括被裁掉的三行？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1290,
          "end": 1290
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1292,
          "end": 1292
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "山门外忽然传来一阵雨声。封山石上方明明没有云，雨却沿着石阶倾泻而下。陆照临怀中的小灯盏轻轻震动，灯罩内壁浮出一行极淡的雾字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1294,
          "end": 1294
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“旧驿道，第一站无灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1296,
          "end": 1296
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他没有把这行字告诉沈砚秋。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1298,
          "end": 1298
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我留在宗门。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1300,
          "end": 1300
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离侧头看他。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1302,
          "end": 1302
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“至少今晚。”他补充。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1304,
          "end": 1304
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有追问期限，只把一把旧铜钥匙交给他：“明日卯时，去外门档房。第三架，最底层。只看写着‘西坡’的卷宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1306,
          "end": 1306
        }
      }
    ],
